    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading the measurements",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 56
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Select a route such as `/api/game/{game_id}/assets/{asset_kind}` or `/pwa/status` to diagnose its response time.\n\nPhases can overlap: authentication includes database and quota work; PWA asset checks include runtime calls. Percentiles describe distributions, not one request, and must not be subtracted to infer CPU time. No browser telemetry requests are added; browser queueing, JavaScript parsing, paint and reverse-proxy timing require DevTools or a browser trace.\n\nQuery families identify credential, quota, games/media, plugin, notification and settings queries from known SQL structure. SQL text, parameter values and account identifiers are not exported. Exact statement analysis and `EXPLAIN` remain on-demand diagnostics. Missing samples mean unobserved work, not zero latency."
      }
    },
